# Repo debugging notes (budget law)

Before debugging or redeploying, read **`.cursor/rules/debugging.md`** if it exists.

## Hard budget (fleet)

| Limit | Value |
|-------|------:|
| `debugging.md` lines | **≤ 200** |
| Failed experiment bullets | **≤ 20**, one line each |

- **Symptom tables** — actionable fix / do-not columns.
- **Failed experiments** — date + what not to repeat (one line). No chat paste.
- **Over budget:** move history to `.cursor/rules/debugging-archive.md` (not always-read). Then shrink primary file.
- **Never** use debugging.md as a session diary, deploy changelog, or ticket dump.
- Fleet check: `cd directory && npm run check:debugging-notes`

## After a failed attempt

Append **one bullet** under Failed experiments. If already at 20 bullets, archive the oldest first.

## Ship

Deploy log success is not done — production verify + Read PNGs when UI changed. See ecosystem-health + agent-verification.
